    "nickname": "0dium",
    "content": "I solved this challenge using this code :\n```\nconst result = values.sort((a, b) => {\n    let maxLength = Math.max(a.length, b.length)\n    const bb = b + a.slice(0, maxLength - b.length)\n    const aa = a + b.slice(0, maxLength - a.length)\n    return bb.localeCompare(aa)\n}).join(``)\n```\n\nI'm am posting this in case you would want contestants to use a different strategy such as a sorted tree\nNice one, cheers !",
    "codingamerHandle": "b0ac67d28857bfc1c8aa3a8fae4171db8660875",
